<title>USA: AMEX to list Snyder Communications options.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Snyder Communications options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Thursday it will list options on Snyder Communications Inc on January 3.</p>
<p>The options will have opening strike prices of 22-1/2, 25 and 30, with initial expirations in January, February, March and June. Cohen, Duffy &amp; McGowan Inc will be the specialist.</p>
<p>Snyder shares closed Thursday at 25-3/4, down 1/2.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
